## Working rules

Run commands from the project root, where `manage.py` and `compose.yaml` live.
Use UV inside the Docker `web` service by default; use local UV when the user
chooses local development. Do not silently switch environments after a failure.
Preserve secrets, existing `.env` files, unrelated work, and database data.
Do not delete data or Docker volumes without explicit user authorization.

